    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 78 Greenhills Estate is now available to the market and presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking an attractive investment property, family home or first-time purchase in a convenient and central location within Ballina town.\n\nIdeally situated just a short stroll from the renowned River Moy and within easy reach of Ballina town centre and all local amenities, this well-proportioned three-bedroom residence offers spacious accommodation and excellent potential for a range of purchasers.\n\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 115 sq. m. (1,238 sq. ft.) and comprises an entrance hall, kitchen, dining room with solid fuel Stanley range, living room with open fireplace, and downstairs WC complete the ground floor. On the first floor there are three bedrooms, bathroom with bath and WHB, and a separate WC.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a paved rear walled garden with side entrance together with a large lawned side garden, providing generous outdoor space.\n\nThe property features PVC double-glazed windows and solid fuel heating.\n\nWhether you are a first-time buyer looking to get onto the property ladder, an investor seeking a well-located rental property, or a family looking for a comfortable home close to all amenities, No. 78 Greenhills Estate is well worth considering.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.59m x 0.64m\n\n\nHall - 4.76m x 1.79m\n\n\nSitting Room - 4.84m 2.80m\n\n\nDining Room - 4.62m x 3.90m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.85m x 2.35m\n\n\nGuest w.c. - 1.08m x 1.65m\n\n\nLanding - 1.90m x 2.62m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.19m x 3.64m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.72m x 2.98m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.52m x 4.41m\n\n\nw.c. - 1.71m x 0.86m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.93m x 1.58m\n\n\n"
